            "Got 15.1 years. Correct answer is 15.8 years. Arithmetic slip in log calculation: h = 20·log(0.5)/log(5/12) = 20·(−0.301)/(−0.380) = 15.8, not 15.1."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "info",
